    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human decision gate\nOnly a recruiter-submitted decision can trigger a candidate email.\n- Shortlist -> invitation draft -> send\n- Reject -> respectful application update -> send\n- Request More Information -> clarification email -> send\n- Hold -> update status and audit log only\n\nProtect this internal form URL. Use reviewer authentication/access controls supported by your n8n deployment. The form URL is not a substitute for proper access control.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      },
